# Third-party reference documents (manuals, standard drawings, catalogues, precedent images) stay on the author's
# machine for development and are never committed: they were removed from the whole history on 2026-10-01.
# Keep new ones in reference/ (ignored). tools/hooks/pre-push also refuses any PDF, DWG or ZIP and any file over 5 MB.
reference/
*.pdf
*.PDF
